Data: data/ibri_hourly.csv.gz and samples/sample_input.csv contain hourly
values from the NASA POWER Project for latitude 23.23, longitude 56.52
(near Ibri, Oman), 2015-2025, downloaded on 1 November 2026.

"These data were obtained from the NASA Langley Research Center (LaRC) POWER
Project funded through the NASA Earth Science/Applied Science Program."

Radiation values come from CERES SYN1deg; weather values from MERRA-2.
